# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Every credential in this repo is read from the environment
# (AGENTS.md: "Never commit tokens, Vapi private keys, SSH passwords or
# Tailscale auth keys"). frontend/.gitignore has covered the frontend since
# the start; these rules cover the rest of the tree, where the env files
# actually live: clawmetry --env-file (BRAIN_API_KEY, COSMOS_API_KEY),
# /etc/d1-console.env (D1_ROBOT_TOKEN), VAPI_PRIVATE_KEY.
# `scripts/audit_secrets.py` is the backstop for anything pasted inline.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
!*.env.example
credentials.json
secrets.json
*.pem
*.key
!*.pub.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
*_rsa
*_ed25519
.netrc
.npmrc
tailscale.auth
authkey*

# The greeter server's on-disk log and session history (per deployment).
tools/robot-face/state/
